  "screenwriter_raw": "{\n  \"pseudos\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p1\",\n      \"text\": \"The Visayas region awoke to a fragile dawn, its heart suddenly exposed. A sudden, jarring rupture in the power supply, a failing heart of the system, had plunged the grid into crisis. This intense, unmet craving for power, driven by seasonal heat, left the vulnerable heart now under threat. The grid operator, the guardian of the grid's stability, sounded an urgent alarm for a threatened region. In a painful but necessary sacrifice for the system's integrity, officials ordered emergency load shedding, forcibly severing connections to save the vital line. The aftermath was a vast, aching void of lost power, with more than 950 megawatts unavailable.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.75,\n      \"center\": \"result-0\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"why-2\", \"how-1\", \"how-2\", \"result-0\"]\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"p2\",\n      \"text\": \"As the intense, unmet craving for power intensified, the grid's delicate balance was tested. The failure of Kepco SPC Power's Unit 2, a power generation unit, was a key trigger. This event, an equipment failure event, combined with other long-running plant outages, represented a pattern of systemic neglect. The system's vital, yet silent, partners in the grid's dance—eleven power generators—were stretched to their limits. The pressure from high demand exposed the energy deficit, making the need for grid stabilization painfully clear.\",\n      \"fit\": 0.7,\n      \"center\": \"why-2\",\n      \"channel\": \"toned\",\n      \"source\": {\n        \"fragments\": [\"why-0\", \"why-1\", \"why-2\", \"how-0\"]\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}",
